  "name": "League Champions & Rift Quality Pack / \u82f1\u96c4\u4e0e\u5ce1\u8c37\u54c1\u8d28\u5347\u7ea7",
  "author": "BoDUD",
  "version": "0.10.13",
  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.13 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and uses the matching official 0.5.1 SDK. Versions 0.10.11 and 0.10.12 are retained as failed portrait-route records: the former visibility toggle missed the dynamic card, while the latter incorrectly required ChampionInfoUIRunner to be discoverable and therefore never emitted its Yone management-card replacement telemetry. The default 0.10.13 Yone-only extension now scans final non-BP RenderState passes for only Yone's observed 93-96x110-123 actor NinePatch, centers it into an exact 85x93 command, and replaces it 1:1 with the existing source-direct high-resolution full-body PNG whose separated legs and boots are already complete. Known blue_picks and red_picks passes, RenderCommand::Sprite battle actors and non-Yone textures cannot match. It does not enable the broader legacy MatchUIRunner, ClientDatabase, BP, server or other-champion rewrite; that full extension remains explicitly opt-in. V6 keeps the official 3502x88 battle canvas, 13 animation tags, rectangles, labels and timings; Q/W/R gameplay, effects, icons and audio remain unchanged, as does the saved-season floor introduced in 0.10.5. Spirit Cleave still performs one stateless 80-degree, 42000-range GameCtx cone scan, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles one shield tier for zero through five champions hit; Mod API 0.8 still requires fixed 0.5-second cast and 8-second cooldown. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op saved-data compatibility only so old embedded trees do not crash after BP. Automated source and build checks do not constitute live visual acceptance; the 0.10.13 card route remains pending in-game user verification.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-21",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.5.1"
    }
  ]
}
